  "prefLabel": "Box 703.04 Compliance with Local Fire and Police Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Box 703.04 Compliance with Local Fire and Police Requirements. A promoter shall schedule the fire and police presence required by the host municipality for the event and shall comply with all local fire and police policies and requirements.\n\nSource. #10483, eff 12-5-13; ss by #14066 eff 8-27-24",
